levels.  As soon as I pressed Return I thought "Wait a minute... Can't
he follow me when I do that?" Yes, he could.  Worse, the level I ended
up on was no-teleport.  Panicked, I started beating on him with
twoweaponed Frost Brand/silver saber until he disappeared.  I could
see him on the upstairs via telepathy, but couldn't follow him.  After
a bit of wandering around, he appeared next to me.  Thinking that he
must have healed fully, I fearfully applied my stethoscope, and found
that he had only 25 hit points!  A couple more whacks, and he was
toast.  I couldn't believe it had been that easy.


